### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","fullName":"Alice Papadopoulou","email":"alice@example.com","department":"Informatics","phone":"6912345678","birthDate":"2000-01-31","password":"secret123"}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"secret123"}

### Me (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### List users (admin token)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

### Change a user's role: USER, MEMBER, BOARD or ADMIN (admin token)
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"BOARD"}

### Calendar events in a date range (MEMBER, BOARD or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/calendar/events?from=2026-08-31&to=2026-10-04
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Schedule an event (BOARD or ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/calendar/events
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Weekly Members Meeting","type":"MEETING","date":"2026-09-07","time":"18:00","location":"Room 1"}
